WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — rce (yo) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:10.239
<v Narrator>Ọjọ́ akọkọ, o kọ́ ìṣàmúlò-ètò kan bí aṣọ́ tí a fi hàn, àti kọ̀ǹpútà náà si gba kódì tí o bá jẹ́ igbẹkẹle lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ nínú gbogbo àwọn èdè.

2
00:00:10.319 --> 00:00:20.879
<v Narrator>Àwọn àgbéwọlé gbogbò tí a lè gbà nìpa ìṣẹ̀dàn tí a sọ̀rọ̀ lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́, láti dáwọ́ sí àwọn ìṣipàrà tí a fi pamọ́ lórí ohunkohun tí o bá rọ́ọ̀nù.

3
00:00:20.959 --> 00:00:25.790
<v Narrator>Àwọn àgbékalẹ̀ tí a fi pamọ́ nípa ìṣàfarawe-ìṣe, ki o si lò lẹ́ẹ̀kan.
